{"parents": [{"link": "../", "title": "Available Types"}], "prev": {"link": "../VideoChatEnded/", "title": "VideoChatEnded"}, "next": {"link": "../PaidMessagePriceChanged/", "title": "PaidMessagePriceChanged"}, "title": "VideoChatParticipantsInvited", "meta": null, "body": "<section id=\"videochatparticipantsinvited\">\n<h1>VideoChatParticipantsInvited<a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#videochatparticipantsinvited\" title=\"Link to this heading\">\u00b6</a></h1>\n<dl class=\"py class\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"pyrogram.types.VideoChatParticipantsInvited\">\n<em class=\"property\"><span class=\"pre\">class</span><span class=\"w\"> </span></em><span class=\"sig-prename descclassname\"><span class=\"pre\">pyrogram.types.</span></span><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">VideoChatParticipantsInvited</span></span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#pyrogram.types.VideoChatParticipantsInvited\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>A service message about new members invited to a voice chat.</p>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Parameters<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><p><strong>users</strong> (List of <a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../User/#pyrogram.types.User\" title=\"pyrogram.types.User\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">User</span></code></a>) \u2013 New members that were invited to the voice chat.</p>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</dd></dl>\n\n</section>\n", "metatags": "<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\" />\n", "rellinks": [["genindex", "General Index", "I", "index"], ["py-modindex", "Python Module Index", "", "modules"], ["api/types/PaidMessagePriceChanged", "PaidMessagePriceChanged", "N", "next"], ["api/types/VideoChatEnded", "VideoChatEnded", "P", "previous"]], "sourcename": "", "toc": "<ul>\n<li><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#\">VideoChatParticipantsInvited</a><ul>\n<li><a clas